  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the tandoor-clay-pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger and cook, stirring occasionally, until onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add red bell pepper and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add fernbrake-gosari, rice, tomato paste, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add 1.2 liters of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and cook, undisturbed, for 25 minutes.",
    "Turn off the heat and let rest, covered, for 10 minutes before serving."
